        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "={{ `Hi ${$json.fields[\"Full Name\"].split(\" \")[0]},\n\nI’m following up on your ${$(\"Filter Due Follow-Ups\").item.json.fields[\"Service Type\"]} request (${$(\"Filter Due Follow-Ups\").item.json.fields[\"Request ID\"]}).\n\nWould you like to proceed, ask a question, or pause this request for now?\n\nRegards,\nBrightNest Cleaning` }}",
